E = m × c²
m (mass) → latent substrate (Stage 0–1b: Origo–Trinitas).
c (speed of light) → universal flow constant (Stage 2–3: Adaptatio–Ecologia).
c² → resonance/amplification factor (feedback squared, Stage 5: Expressio–Circulatio).
