✨ Refinement insight:
In physics, the flow-constant is fixed (c = speed of light).
In biology, the flow-constant is adaptive (c = metabolic turnover speed, varies across organisms).
So biology generalizes Einstein: system energy depends not on a universal c, but on an adaptive c tuned to ecological context.
